    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drywall Eating Simulator is a physics-based 3D adventure game where you are pushed to the limits of human (or nonhuman) tolerance by the people you encounter in our world, and the only pressure release that you have is in the name of the game (eating drywall)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple environments, try to maintain your composure and fit into society. Or just bash your head against every wall you can access. It's your simulation after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749110/extras/ec416cced8f901b2b4e06be3f2db099b.poster.avif?t=1753991062\" width=424 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749110/extras/ec416cced8f901b2b4e06be3f2db099b.webm?t=1753991062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749110/extras/ec416cced8f901b2b4e06be3f2db099b.mp4?t=1753991062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your environment through the mundane life of capitalistic society member!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with a colorful cast of fellow humans to talk to!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat drywall!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But also...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid various nosy NPCs trying to get up in your business...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let your anger get out of control...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your secret safe...</p></li></ul>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Drywall Eating Simulator is a physics-based 3D adventure game where you are pushed to the limits of human (or nonhuman) tolerance by the people you encounter in our world, and the only pressure release that you have is in the name of the game (eating drywall)</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore multiple environments, try to maintain your composure and fit into society. Or just bash your head against every wall you can access. It's your simulation after all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749110/extras/ec416cced8f901b2b4e06be3f2db099b.poster.avif?t=1753991062\" width=424 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749110/extras/ec416cced8f901b2b4e06be3f2db099b.webm?t=1753991062\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3749110/extras/ec416cced8f901b2b4e06be3f2db099b.mp4?t=1753991062\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your environment through the mundane life of capitalistic society member!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple levels with a colorful cast of fellow humans to talk to!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Eat drywall!</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >But also...</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Avoid various nosy NPCs trying to get up in your business...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't let your anger get out of control...</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Keep your secret safe...</p></li></ul>",
